<p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">Hi <%= @user.first_name %>,</p>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">
  <% if @membership %>
    You've been added to Cap City's <strong><%= @membership.season.year %> season</strong><%= " with #{@membership.ensemble}" if @membership.ensemble.present? %>, and you now have an account on our member site.
  <% else %>
    You now have an account on Cap City's member site.
  <% end %>
</p>

<% if @membership.nil? || @membership.role == 'member' %>
  <p style="margin: 0 0 8px;">It's where you'll:</p>
  <ul style="margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li>tell us about rehearsals you can't make</li>
    <li>see what you owe in dues, and pay online</li>
    <li>follow your calendar fundraiser</li>
  </ul>
<% end %>

<p style="margin: 0;">
  To get started, choose a password. Enter this email address (<%= @user.email %>) on the next page and we'll send you a link to set one.
</p>

<%= email_button 'Choose your password', @url %>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">After that, sign in with your email address and the password you chose.</p>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px; color: #5f6368; font-size: 14px;">
  Weren't expecting this? Let a Cap City staff member know, or just ignore it.
</p>

<p style="margin: 0;">See you at rehearsal,<br />Cap City</p>
